<title>UK: Wolv &amp; Dudley like-for-like sales flat.</title>
<headline>Wolv &amp; Dudley like-for-like sales flat.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brewer Wolverhampton &amp; Dudley Breweries Plc said on Tuesday that like-for-like sales in its managed houses were at the same level as last year in the 16 weeks to January 19.</p>
<p>It said group turnover in the period rose 14 percent overall.</p>
</text>
